# {{projectName}}

Built with Angular + NgRx state management.

## Stack
- **Framework:** Angular (standalone components + NgRx)
- **State:** NgRx Store, Effects, Selectors, Actions
- **Language:** TypeScript
{{#if useMaterial}}
- **UI:** Angular Material
{{/if}}
{{#if useTests}}
- **Tests:** Jest + jest-preset-angular
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
- **E2E:** Playwright
{{/if}}

## Project Structure (NgRx Feature Slice)
```
src/app/
  app.component.ts
  app.routes.ts             # Lazy-loaded feature routes

  features/{{moduleName}}/
    +state/
      {{moduleName}}.actions.ts    # Action groups
      {{moduleName}}.reducer.ts    # State reducer
      {{moduleName}}.effects.ts    # Side effects
      {{moduleName}}.selectors.ts  # Memoized selectors
    {{moduleName}}.component.ts    # Feature UI component
    {{moduleName}}.model.ts        # Entity model/interface
    {{moduleName}}.routes.ts       # Feature routing + store providers
    {{moduleName}}.service.ts      # API/data service
```

## Commands
```bash
npm start        # Start dev server
npm run build    # Production build
{{#if useTests}}
npm test         # Run tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useE2E}}
npm run test:e2e # Run E2E tests
{{/if}}
{{#if useLint}}
npm run lint     # Lint code
npm run format   # Format code
{{/if}}
```
